#### Escapes in a text literal

A text literal carries five one-character escapes and one that names a code
point:

| Written | Reads as |
|---|---|
| `\n` | line feed |
| `\t` | tab |
| `\r` | carriage return |
| `\"` | `"` |
| `\\` | `\` |
| `\uXXXX` | the character the four hex digits name |
